    <h2>Live statistics have ended</h2>
    <p>The original page displayed aggregate trips, countries, and calendar days from the running app. The account database has been deleted, so those statistics are no longer available. No historical totals are presented here.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Explore the original project</h2>
    <p><a href="/#history">View the original interface and project story</a>, or explore the <a href="https://github.com/santi020k/nomad-counter">archived source code</a>.</p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
